# Path of the Beastmaster (jeuno 19) below ADVANCED_JOB_LEVEL (30), Save My Son completed: no section. No quest acts
# at Brutus (Chocobo's Wounds' 22 needs Save My Son not completed), so his default 66 and his silent script take turns:
# 66 both times (the script's turn falls back to the default when it does nothing).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 lvl=29
quest Jeuno.ChocoboOnTheLoose completed
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
login
trigger Brutus                  # level 29: no section; the default 66
finish
trigger Brutus                  # the script's turn, silent: the default 66 again
finish
